gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Hi! Sorry to keep you waiting!\p"
	.string "Welcome to the world of POKéMON!\p"
	.string "My name is BIRCH.\p"
	.string "But everyone calls me the POKéMON\n"
	.string "PROFESSOR.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is what we call a “POKéMON.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

@ Emerald Champions: Birch's monologue is the one moment every new save
@ passes through before any mechanic bites, so it carries the explainer.
@ One page of lore, then what is different and where to do it.
gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "This world is widely inhabited by\n"
	.string "creatures known as POKéMON.\p"
	.string "But this HOENN is a little different.\n"
	.string "Here, POKéMON are built, not raised.\p"
	.string "Let me walk you through it.\n"
	.string "First, catch POKéMON. Lots of them.\p"
	.string "Every one has perfect potential\n"
	.string "and comes with a competitive\l"
	.string "BATTLE SET already on it.\p"
	.string "Wild POKéMON from every region live\n"
	.string "throughout HOENN. Some legendary\l"
	.string "discoveries are 1% wild encounters.\p"
	.string "SWEET SCENT gives a 25% chance of\n"
	.string "an available local legendary.\p"
	.string "Shared areas split that chance evenly.\n"
	.string "Badges and story requirements apply.\p"
	.string "The REPEL SPRAY keeps the rest away\n"
	.string "while you travel.\p"
	.string "Next, level them. The LEVELER raises\n"
	.string "your whole team to the level cap\l"
	.string "instantly, as often as you like.\p"
	.string "The cap rises with each BADGE.\n"
	.string "There is no grinding. Ever.\p"
	.string "BADGES also unlock CUT, SURF and the\n"
	.string "rest. Any POKéMON in your party that\l"
	.string "could learn one can use it.\p"
	.string "The FLIGHT BEACON calls a ride the\n"
	.string "moment you can FLY.\p"
	.string "Then build them. Every POKéMON\n"
	.string "CENTER has a TUTOR. Talk to them.\p"
	.string "The TUTOR teaches any move that\n"
	.string "POKéMON can learn.\p"
	.string "The TUTOR changes its NATURE.\n"
	.string "Its ABILITY you can change yourself,\l"
	.string "right from the party menu.\p"
	.string "The TUTOR edits its EVs:\n"
	.string "510 to spend, up to 252 per stat.\l"
	.string "Their effect scales with level.\p"
	.string "The TUTOR shows the stat as you\n"
	.string "spend, so tune it. Don't guess.\p"
	.string "Or skip all that and pick a\n"
	.string "BATTLE SET: moves, NATURE, held item\l"
	.string "and EVs in one choice.\p"
	.string "Held items are free from the VENDOR in\n"
	.string "every POKéMON CENTER.\p"
	.string "All of it is free. Change it anytime.\p"
	.string "Then battle. Battles are mostly\n"
	.string "DOUBLES, and TRAINERS play to win.\p"
	.string "When you pick a move, press L to see\n"
	.string "the foes' types. R shows the move.\p"
	.string "You will lose sometimes.\n"
	.string "That's the point, not the end.\p"
	.string "Save before a big battle. If you lose,\n"
	.string "choose RELOAD in the menu and retry.\p"
	.string "Catch. Level. Build. Battle.\n"
	.string "Then build again, better.\p"
	.string "Think of it as POKéMON CHAMPIONS,\n"
	.string "played across all of HOENN.\p"
	.string "That's what I do here now: I help\n"
	.string "TRAINERS build. So, let's begin.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you are?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Ah, okay!\p"
	.string "You're {PLAYER}{KUN} who's moving to my\n"
	.string "hometown of LITTLEROOT.\l"
	.string "I get it now!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "All right, are you ready?\p"
	.string "Your very own adventure is about\n"
	.string "to unfold.\p"
	.string "Take courage, and leap into the\n"
	.string "world of POKéMON where dreams,\l"
	.string "adventure, and friendships await!\p"
	.string "Well, I'll be expecting you later.\n"
	.string "Come see me in my POKéMON LAB.\p"
	.string "$"
